--- !u!114 &1533119980787197115
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4354580147320970888}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 86a2dbea93805024a9c1d5023d37ee79, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TextController
  messages:
  - You see those balls? those are gonna be the key to getting out of here!
  - Whenever you shoot a ball with your air cannon, it becomes marked.
  - This makes it YOUR ball, this will allow you to manipulate it differently.
  - While a ball is marked, you can hold E to get it to return back to you, letting
    you hold it!
  - However, don't let go of E until the ball is held, these things are explosive
    and without the proper protection... You will explode
  - To get through these rooms, you're gonna have to break the targets. There's one
    big catch though...
  - Your marked balls cannot break them, you'll have to bounce it off the other balls
    in the room into the targets.
  - Again, be careful since these things WILL explode upon contact...
  - Good luck! And don't blow us up...
